    {
      "id": "file",
      "kind": "node",
      "shape": "document",
      "label": "theme.css",
      "detail": ":root and dark blocks only",
      "note": "For example `:root { --accent: #7c3aed; }` and `:root[data-theme=\"dark\"] { --accent: #a78bfa; }`. A fixed name at the Saga root, so a Saga has one theme and `saga.json` is unchanged.",
